4.6 Validation using experimentally characterized reference ligands 

To evaluate the structural relevance of the selected DBP, four experimentally characterized reference ligands were docked using the same receptor structure and docking parameters. 

The reference compounds produced Vina scores ranging from −9.355 to −10.72 kcal/mol. Core-residue analysis showed that three of the four reference ligands established contacts with five or six of the six predefined DBP residues, while CHEMBL191703 established contacts with four of six residues (Ref- Vina). 

